Z||000003||DRH||08-31-2001||03:06 PM||||Crawl under the dash and check under your carpet. When the master cylinder seal starts leaking it leaks INSIDE the car (nice GM design). My carpet padding was SOAKED before I figured out what was going on.<P>||||reg||3
Z||000004||Wolfhound||08-31-2001||03:14 PM||||Pull back the rubber boot on the slave cylinder. If thats the problem the boot will contain fluid.||||reg||1
